        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. I'm starting to regret this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sneaking in here... was not a good idea.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The higher the place, the more complete and larger the shadows are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this place is a little too high up...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovementsp",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 5,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-30,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#10$1",
        "posfrom": "30,0",
        "posto": "10,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Can you let me go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No can do, girlie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you get any funny ideas either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "This ship is way too big. I'd really appreciate a cute girl helping me keep an eye out for any soldiers popping up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you also call yourself a Victorian Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I'm a Kazdel Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, but... if you're a Kazdel Sarkaz...? Then why are you...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aren't you working for General Manfred and the Military Commission?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I work only for myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's this ship headed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't like seeing kids suffer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I don't know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I really don't!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What exactly is your job here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... being a Sarkaz mercenary?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh. A Sarkaz mercenary who hasn't killed before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't even silently draw your weapon while being captured.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "-30,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#10$1",
        "posfrom": "10,0",
        "posto": "-180,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's Manfred even planning to do here? Open a kindergarten?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#15$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "General Manfred says he wants me to learn what war is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, how's that going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#15$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think it's just people killing another group of people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Congratulations, we share the same view.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This ship sure flies high.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The General says it's because it's a revenant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#13$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh. A revenant. So that's why.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why Ascalon was in so much pain. Good thing they're conspicuous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#13$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This ship is still ascending.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Judging by our heading... it's not flying towards the battlefield. This ship is returning to Londinium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You flew out of Londinium, fired a shot at the Duke's warship, and then stopped for a few days in Norport Borough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "And now that the dukes are on their way with their fleets, you're retreating?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems like I need to change my impression of Manfred. Not only is he passionate about pedagogy, but he likes to take the ship out for little drives too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, you don't know anything at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's your name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Paprika.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you're the Paprika mentioned in the report I read. You freed the workers from Munitions Factory No. 11, and then you were caught by Manfred.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "For a Sarkaz mercenary, is that... not honorable?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "For a Sarkaz mercenary, honor is the worst kind of shame.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been to Kazdel before, right? What is it like?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "My old captain told me that it's our homeland.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where did you grow up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Columbia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No wonder.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every Sarkaz that hasn't been to Kazdel thinks it's probably an adorable, sweet little place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's just your own wishful thinking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Think of the filthiest, most disgusting, any derogatory adjective you can muster, and multiply that by a hundred\u2014now <i>that's</i> Kazdel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sounds like most people wouldn't like it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then why... why do so many Sarkaz call it home?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because they need a home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "They think, as long as they have a home, everything will fall neatly into place, all discrimination and persecution against them will cease and they'll once again be able to puff out their chests in pride.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#13$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. It's silly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or maybe you think that... because you're not a Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#13$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You like to ask questions, little girl, but that's not a good habit in wartime.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I was only making a guess! Please don't get angry!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm just real curious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nobody here wants to talk to me, and General Manfred is always busy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're all so excited and always talk about doing great things... but why don't I feel it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "All I've seen is familiar faces dying one by one, getting replaced by fresh faces, but when those become familiar...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The same thing just happens again and again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I feel like I shouldn't be here at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does it actually matter if someone is really a Sarkaz or not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If everyone thinks you're a Sarkaz, then you might as well grind down your horns and pretend to be one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fixed",
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because you can only survive as a Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And when it comes to surviving, your feelings don't matter at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that's why you joined this war with the Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems like you should stay with Manfred a while longer. He hasn't taught you the most important things you need to know about war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "General Manfred lent me a book, <i>A History of Sarkaz War.</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know the author. His name is Hoederer, and he's an idiot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Sarkaz War,' 'Victorian War,' 'Ducal War,' 'Royal Court War,' only an idiot talks about stuff like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who'd be arrogant enough to claim a war for themselves? I sure wouldn't, at least.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "War is war, and that's all there is to it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't believe this war can save us all... Then what do you believe in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I believe when you're hungry, you have to eat, when you're thirsty, you need to drink, swinging your arms around for too long will tire you out, and if I jump out of this ship I will die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I only believe in these things that can't be given meaning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Toying around with 'meaning' is the root of all suffering.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "duration": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In the same way, I believe that profits make people impulsive, fear makes them impatient, a burning fire can not be easily extinguished, and the resulting conflicts cannot be easily ended.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$frontline_intro",
        "key": "$frontline_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Ines, as a guest, you should have greeted me first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been a while, Manfred.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed it has.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, why don't you stay? You can admire the scenery with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The storm is approaching quickly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ines and Manfred turn to look out the window."
    },
    {
        "text": "They see the smoke and dust rising in the distance, and several high-speed battleship fleets approaching."
    },
    {
        "text": "This airship high up in the sky is attracting the attention of every ducal force already stationed nearby."
    },
    {
        "text": "A sudden flash of clarity shoots through Ines upon seeing these little battleships scrambling like insects in the shadow of the airship."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want the flames.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, the flames have already been ignited, you're just... using this ship as kindling to keep it in the air.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Caster, Wellington, Windermere, and maybe Normandy too...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The representatives of these greedy dukes are already all gathered on this plate, while their masters' fleets observe their rivals as they make their way here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This airship is moving so slowly because you're waiting for them, you're tempting them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The dukes would rather not let the airship hide behind Londinium's robust city walls, so they'll gather here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And this is what you've all been waiting for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "An perfectly little... shooting gallery for The Shard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Should I be glad that Hoederer's partner is so sharp?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A shame you put it together so late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Men, seize her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
