        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So what did she tell you, Paprika?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She said, war is war, and that's all there is to it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed, that's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If she could just see the big picture, just how many things surrounding war would she see?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "37_g9_airshipdockcorridor",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This intelligence must be delivered."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ines has to admit that the Military Commission has drawn up a brilliant plan."
    },
    {
        "text": "She can foresee what will happen next."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Shard's Catastrophe will severely damage the dukes' forces, and furthermore, said damage will be credited to not just the Sarkaz, but also to their respective rivals."
    },
    {
        "text": "And once Victoria's storm-bringing prowess is drawn out into the open, any country across the lands will feel fear, and also fury."
    },
    {
        "text": "Every seat of power will want to destroy this one, or possess it for themselves."
    },
    {
        "text": "What if, at this time\u2014the dukes guarding the borders slack on their duties because of their infighting?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leithanien, Ursus, Kazimierz, and even the old Gaulish regions would never let this opportunity slip."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is only the first flame."
    },
    {
        "text": "Soon, an unstoppable blaze will sweep across the entire land."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ines knows, there is still time, it's not too late."
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as she can get the information out\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "A shadow approaches at the end of the corridor. It is not her own shadow, but the owner of this vessel."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ines, who has heard rumors from her old partner about the revenant, is for the first time in her life glad that she isn't a real Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep, shadow's still there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The sun rises, the long night having finally passed, and the mobile plate below her casts an extremely long shadow."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should thank myself for finding such a high place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm guessing that a jump from here would probably kill me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, who would have thought that today, the Ines who always comes back from the brink of death, is finally embracing it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoederer and W are gonna laugh themselves to death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope they don't get to see me in such a wretched state.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014*exhale*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
