    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She falls, a gale blowing through her hair, and she can hardly keep her eyes open."
    },
    {
        "text": "But it is only at this height that she can take all the shadows of Norport into her view."
    },
    {
        "text": "Only at this height can she manipulate these shadows that stretch as far as she can see."
    },
    {
        "text": "She knows that she only has a few seconds to make it, quickly falling into the shadows before her."
    },
    {
        "text": "Now."
    },
    {
        "text": "Death is already lingering beyond the door."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
